      { icon: icons.eye, accent: "green", title: "Go see the work", body: "We start where the work happens: the line, the barn, the front desk. Requirements come from watching, not guessing." },
      { icon: icons.steps, accent: "blue", title: "Ship in small steps", body: "You get working software early and in pieces you can test, not one big reveal at the end." },
      { icon: icons.server, accent: "purple", title: "Run what we build", body: "We operate our own products in production, so we plan for backups, outages, and support from the first sprint." },
      { icon: icons.doc, accent: "orange", title: "Say it plainly", body: "Scope and price in writing, estimates we stand behind, and documentation your team can actually follow." },
